# The files of support/cryptography that are taken from Odin's core:crypto
# (docs/CRYPTOGRAPHY.md). Each line: the file of the repository, the file
# under the root of Odin, the BLAKE3 hash of that origin file. The check
# `kerneltool cryptography-origin` (also in `kerneltool check`) proves that
# each file is its origin with the import changes of
# tools/kerneltool/cryptography_origin.odin and nothing else. A new line
# comes from `kerneltool cryptography-take <origin> <file>`.
